{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "35e30adfa2fbb6f1157614e3130cf8b91251e9bcdb129560d9bf4efaeb7c1b24", "ja": "キスの理由", "zh": "亲吻的理由", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b05f5cb15a579680459e2dc94ca7b296b67c40514a3bb441d463d63660cfc82b", "ja": "新曲への理解を深めるため、歌詞の考察を\n始めるアイドル達。なぜキスをするのか？\nとの疑問を持った志保に、自分なりの答えを\n語る琴葉。聞いていた海美と亜利沙も、\nドキドキしてしまうのだった。", "zh": "偶像们开始深入思考新歌的歌词，以加深对歌曲的理解。志保疑惑为什么要接吻，琴叶讲述了自己对此的答案。听到这些的海美和亚利沙，也不禁怦然心动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "71cda7fc9c3564128a8a8ce73e7b8670a89ab27d557bb47f363dcd921193db6d", "ja": "（天体公演のレッスンが始まった！　みんなは\nまず、曲の理解を深める事にしたみたいだ……）", "zh": "（天体公演的练习开始了！大家似乎决定先加深对歌曲的理解……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "01864ba4cd5e25d20bdd2b09a1570c47d08632cbca1c0bdb8248000f2d518569", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nあの、会議室の鍵をお借りしてもいいですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n那个，可以借用一下会议室的钥匙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3918257070d52efc5a4fccb88922231c26abbe82d773ebf7a106b35836e2e5b8", "ja": "お疲れ様、琴葉。\n今日は、勉強会をするんだっけ？", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶。\n今天是要开学习会来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "136415e62413becc7995e6ff36f47228c87891fe929116f494c3da32d82a8e1e", "ja": "はい。みんなの反応を見ていたら、曲や歌詞の世界を\n理解してから、レッスンした方がよさそうだと思って。", "zh": "是的。我觉得，与其先去练习，不如先理解歌曲和歌词的世界观，再看看大家的反应。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b0e79da7a16a0e25bf24f9e434ec325c6f3dcf907390908d6fc11cfdddfd026a", "ja": "そうか。……うまくいきそうか？", "zh": "这样啊……进展还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "d082e95c7b455b66888b73163530d1210798bc785fb8cc20482554614672485c", "ja": "そうですね。まだ、始まったばかりですから……\nでも、楽しいメンバーですよね。", "zh": "是啊。毕竟才刚刚开始……\n不过，成员们都很有趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "b6ff05a075650f209adfe69a94b6c299b59b4686525725d00a89ee10d4c4b6d0", "ja": "不安があるとすれば……歌詞が、その……。", "zh": "要说有什么不安的话……歌词方面，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "648a25939a3ff0c84aaaf41f24c0df57523e428e2463833ff904874849da2689", "ja": "歌詞？", "zh": "歌词？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "eaeb3b27f97c063b0a82cec747bbcd1bb886bdaa4c86dc82e8a29c942cfb7dee", "ja": "い、いえ！　何でもありません！　……あの、\n{$P$}、ひとつお願いがあるんです。", "zh": "没、没什么！什么事也没有！……那个，\n{$P$}，我有件事想拜托您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "02ab95a7fdf184a5bf50a6f85795e0757a9f9c8858796561bde416abb4286ee3", "ja": "今日は集中して取り組みたいので、できれば、私たちの\n様子を見に来ないでもらえればと……すみません。", "zh": "今天我想集中精力好好进行，如果可以的话，能不能请您别过来看我们……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1fbf006bb9df708030b7b1bd055bfa52a4f60c3d94fe33c25a566e81ad218d65", "ja": "ああ、わかった。\n琴葉もいるし、今日のところは任せるよ！", "zh": "啊，知道了。\n既然琴叶也在，今天就交给你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "eae23a275e4a7ef445677ae3b1de914ae6001bfb68f2ca927d6b30323d4a5a61", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます。\nそれじゃ、失礼します。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您。\n那么，我先告辞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "03a6a544993fbb3602881f4b98b42d6a39247b5d8b7cfd02092acbd273a91a50", "ja": "それじゃ、勉強会を始めるね。まずは……\nみんな、歌詞を読んで、どんなイメージを持った？", "zh": "那么，学习会就开始啦。首先是……\n大家读完歌词后，有什么样的印象？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "8df90e15640d06d56c95b32fdfac4ac6f280d5c5291caa53c179a1e717a4e3cc", "ja": "はいはーい！　私はね、\n恋愛ドラマとかで流れてそうだなーって！", "zh": "好——！我觉得呢，这首歌听起来就像是会在恋爱剧里播放的那种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "8e7c20998e58b50854df8e9005838c9921c068cb4d6f22556e19a78b883408c7", "ja": "ふふ、たしかにそうだね。……ところで、\n『リフレインキス』って、どういう意味だかわかる？", "zh": "呵呵，确实是这样呢。……对了，你知道《Refrain Kiss》是什么意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "9bc5230fac8e69217b031f604fd37e650a3416f804b9815ac5413406b2333f54", "ja": "うーん……？", "zh": "嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "9bc5230fac8e69217b031f604fd37e650a3416f804b9815ac5413406b2333f54", "ja": "うーん……？", "zh": "嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "1b0f038fea510482f2e31d3a4c0f0479d95276502602ba3ff9a6059edcc178e9", "ja": "『リフレイン』は、自制するって意味なんだけど。\n音楽用語だと、繰り返しって意味で使うよね。", "zh": "《Refrain》是“自我克制”的意思。\n不过在音乐术语中，是用来表示“反复”的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "4e65e87694b9ba7ea41fbab6f4ead12a1bb10f57be8dbd3c634db24909875fb1", "ja": "自制するキス？　自分を抑えなきゃいけない……\n我慢しなきゃいけないってこと？", "zh": "克制的吻？就是说必须压抑自己……\n必须忍耐的意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "2d32c25394e26151ade3b5bf78875d644217e6d5a5b55eb4ec856a945bea9666", "ja": "うーん……ありさ的には、『繰り返し』の方が\n歌詞にピッタリだと思いますけど……。", "zh": "嗯……以亚利沙的看法，我觉得“反复”更符合歌词……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "bfe01e9b9925b45e347597d38eb9073ea575b43e1f7bc0b159121be17640ef3e", "ja": "きっとその両方じゃないかな？　繰り返したい程、\n我慢できないくらいの気持ちってことかも。", "zh": "我觉得应该两者都是吧？也许是那种想要反复到无法忍耐的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "809a46eee1bde1dcddb8322b8537ae8d5e2dca95b2a30f386745a215dc1f4904", "ja": "あの、すみません。\nその前に、聞きたいことがあるんですけど。", "zh": "那个，不好意思。\n在那之前，我有件事想问。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "9a69e2184f2f5c5f59549e30fa27f8411a3d96aacd93ec73dd345909ab363bf8", "ja": "どうして、キスをしたくなるんでしょうか？", "zh": "为什么会想要接吻呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "61953915abdd80725a7476268dbfedf46724108b174b6fd5ee4b02ec575039a2", "ja": "そ、それは……ど、どうしてだろうね！？\nあっ……ありりん、パスッ！", "zh": "那、那是……为、为什么会想亲吻呢！？\n啊……亚、亚里琳，交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "ee92144cf369bf1b9f5720e154acb5f80f2c86684826c81cf499aeb46b9f46e1", "ja": "ええっ！？　ありさ……いえ、アイドルちゃん的に、\nキ、キ……そういうのは、ダメなんじゃないかとっ！", "zh": "诶！？从亚利莎……不，从偶像女孩的角度来说，亲、亲……这种事，应该是不行的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "bad967b40d151c2ee1a9b89d1c84e1b4904a97c7928b35394397025eee7547a4", "ja": "すみません、みなさんを困らせるつもりはなくて。\nただ、気持ち悪くないですか？　口を付けるなんて……", "zh": "对不起，我没打算让大家为难。只是……不觉得很恶心吗？居然要碰嘴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "250ae2984fa41ed38fa52ee404b3666f92e5689de70e1eefa086c1c326c32bd8", "ja": "相手の人のことを好きだったとしても、\n言葉で伝えるだけじゃダメなんですか？", "zh": "即使喜欢对方，也不能只用语言表达吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "e5fbaf33918617bbbb950449671f7405b0e0bce8970fa24d2cc1912e4f1f820c", "ja": "あっ……うん、そうだね。\nえっと、うまく言えるかどうかわからないけど……。", "zh": "啊……嗯，是啊。\n那个……我也不知道能不能好好说清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "4ed384a43333056660a38111f7d8a3e96667dc462d5ed803f4c05ef9fd77ed8b", "ja": "お芝居や物語なら、台詞……\n言葉で伝えるのが一番かもしれないよね。", "zh": "如果是戏剧或故事，台词……\n也许用语言传达是最好的方式吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1033_017kth", "source_sha256": "5fab849eecb6e7a35bb5125e2dabc6122acb2ca8db52fe268b0c23648df22436", "ja": "でも、フィクションは先の流れが決まっているけど。\n現実は、そうじゃないから……。", "zh": "不过，虚构作品的发展走向是既定的。\n但现实并不是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "a16a012fda56f2d6a186b6fd02b93a982c6b4bae088898f7a2d17dfd206a5ab1", "ja": "今の関係を変えたいなら、言葉だけでなく……\n自分の全てで、伝えようとするんじゃないかな。", "zh": "如果想改变现在的关系，就不会只靠言语……\n而是会用自己的一切，努力传达心意吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1036_017kth", "source_sha256": "6d4ac7e636d988af68718ac89b070bee0b39723e3d5e4047395f6873a85b6185", "ja": "「あなたのことが好きです」って……。", "zh": "“我喜欢你”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1037_029umi", "source_sha256": "05ffd0856d5647722ed9dc1b8219618767189bf2351bbdfdfe7a4335730f0505", "ja": "おお～……。", "zh": "哦喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "05ffd0856d5647722ed9dc1b8219618767189bf2351bbdfdfe7a4335730f0505", "ja": "おお～……。", "zh": "哦喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1039_017kth", "source_sha256": "6049bd6b54a01daab9af002eddfe7761f73b1470763f0cb87fecbe28bedeceed", "ja": "恋愛感情って、想像より生々しいものなのかも。\n志保ちゃんだって、好きな人とならきっと……。", "zh": "恋爱这种感情，说不定比想象中还要真实呢。\n就算是志保，如果是和喜欢的人在一起，肯定也会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "015a0b8607c33f32b05c72e5cfc0529724f2422be8b967162e34408b41c7a9f4", "ja": "……あの。\n琴葉さんは、好きな人がいるんですか？", "zh": "……那个。\n琴叶小姐有喜欢的人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1041_017kth", "source_sha256": "b027eb79de6ba4dbf77037d2fda7c07f6680eb65342cd6bafff0e1be435e24b5", "ja": "えっ！？　……あっ、ご、ごめんね、みんな！？\n私ひとりでベラベラ喋っちゃって……。", "zh": "诶！？……啊，对、对不起，大家！？\n我一个人说个不停……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "f1a91ff9f6906b3d1b00e5b425f14c6805c09502ddb483914c2cccfff19d6ab0", "ja": "ううん！　琴葉の話、すっごく参考になった！\nね、ありりん！", "zh": "没有的事！琴叶说的内容，非常有参考价值呢！\n对吧，亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1043_028ari", "source_sha256": "93d9df5b144b3675c68ebe33ae8b98359c3cbeaa0ff3acd241c716bc86a6b22b", "ja": "はい！　……でもありさ、琴葉ちゃんの話を聞いてた\nだけなのに、なんだか恥ずかしくなってきました……。", "zh": "是的！……可是，明明只是听着琴叶的话，阿利莎却不知怎么的，开始觉得不好意思了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1044_029umi", "source_sha256": "fea77bbb11061d7f1edbdc6b32b05fc8a1b0767724a8e0508ec250af4c3a468b", "ja": "う、うん。琴葉の言葉って、説得力があるんだよね。\nだからかな……私もほっぺたが熱くて……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。琴叶的话，真的很有说服力呢。\n也许是因为这个吧……我的脸颊也热热的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1045_017kth", "source_sha256": "a06da3e153fbbe441f6e7e5a9f86b3a776b97d82676ba4f1d2dda5303fb404b3", "ja": "ち、違うの！　これは個人的な意見……というか、\n私が想像する、恋の話だから！　誤解しないで！", "zh": "不、不对！这是我个人的意见……应该说，是我所想象的恋爱故事！你可别误会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1046_033sih", "source_sha256": "f2b4500a2460d295d4d35334c7088584ceb49228355162dba6d4cd9e83d02290", "ja": "そうなんですか。\n……やっぱり、難しそうですね。", "zh": "是这样啊。\n……果然，感觉还是很难呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1047_017kth", "source_sha256": "d75ab6808cc292932e292a3ead704b749615c8498a62563e4322598bc6e3dec0", "ja": "だ、大丈夫だよ志保ちゃん！\nさぁみんな、勉強を続けよう！", "zh": "没、没关系的，志保！\n好了，大家继续学习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1049_p", "source_sha256": "6f3f86a8ccfbcf36aa606438ec23e78a2d37879a8814a8c2a3ae27c875ff8ffd", "ja": "（会議室の鍵を返しにきた琴葉に、勉強会の内容を\n聞いてみたが、詳細は教えてもらえなかった……）", "zh": "（我向来归还会议室钥匙的琴叶询问了学习会的内容，但她没有告诉我详情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_02_1050_p", "source_sha256": "242e9df042abe52945eb2eaf6e9ef975d814eed191cfe6ca6be8b2948dd40690", "ja": "（一体、どんな勉強をしたんだろう……気になるな）", "zh": "（到底学习了些什么呢……真让人在意啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
